[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6961.109, "timestamp": "01:56:01", "text": "だって、ボタンが最小限しかなかったから。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6965.27, "timestamp": "01:56:05", "text": "例えば、75% 60 キーボードのようなもの。キーボード60台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6966.99, "timestamp": "01:56:06", "text": "本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6973.35, "timestamp": "01:56:13", "text": "えっと、あれは何て呼ばれてるんだっけ？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6983.606, "timestamp": "01:56:23", "author": "@kaiguyniki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/f9aZERpOc1bv1JDUl12ZTXeQ7j1KdXBflkbl-6qlBLzM-hbbEQKWUlPpcJJxTU-qSUwNxrez=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "TKL"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6983.75, "timestamp": "01:56:23", "text": "TKLキーボード（重量10キロ）。 10キロ。ええ、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6985.669, "timestamp": "01:56:25", "text": "あれら大好きです。特に私のキーボードは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6994.709, "timestamp": "01:56:34", "text": "ロジクール製のものを検討しています。ロジクール"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6998.149, "timestamp": "01:56:38", "text": "プロX。よし。それ、すごく好き。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7000.95, "timestamp": "01:56:40", "text": "ああ、ロジクール製はどれだったか忘れちゃった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7003.91, "timestamp": "01:56:43", "text": "1つ。そうそう。うん。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7005.75, "timestamp": "01:56:45", "text": "それを買うかもしれない。私はしない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7008.589, "timestamp": "01:56:48", "text": "嘘。白い"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7011.75, "timestamp": "01:56:51", "text": "それ。白いセットアップを構築したい。おお、"}]